      "side": 1,
      "message": "Advising operators to put a review account\u0027s *email* into `OTP_IGNORE_ACCOUNTS` ties an OTP bypass to a value that PortaBilling doesn\u0027t keep unique. If the review account is later closed and another account gets the same email, the bypass silently moves to that account. I\u0027d recommend that review accounts keep signing in by id, or explain here why the email form is safe.\n\n**Co-Reviewed By: deep-code-reviewer**",
      "revId": "96cdb4aa96a101216a8666edbdab12405d2e9ea6",
      "serverId": "b3d83be1-eb64-49fe-9bf1-b81a817d2fd2"
