      "writtenOn": "2026-11-05T09:33:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`casefold()` assumes the database compares `Accounts.email` without case too. With a case-sensitive comparison, `John_Doe@…` never reaches the post-filter and the user gets a 404, even though `test_the_address_is_compared_without_case` says otherwise. Please confirm on a live switch, ideally Ifonica\u0027s, by requesting a code with an upper-case version of an existing address.\n\n**Co-Reviewed By: deep-code-reviewer**",
      "revId": "96cdb4aa96a101216a8666edbdab12405d2e9ea6",
      "serverId": "b3d83be1-eb64-49fe-9bf1-b81a817d2fd2"
    },
