      "message": "`ambiguous_user_ref` is new and no client handles it yet. It is missing from the mobile app\u0027s `login_error_notification.dart` map and from the web-app i18n, so users will see a generic error. Please open follow-up tickets for mobile-app and web-app and link them to WT-2212.\n\nAlso note that 404, 422 and 200 now tell an unauthenticated caller whether an email is registered and whether it is shared. The id flow already does this for ids, so this is not a blocker, but it\u0027s worth a line in the ticket, since emails are more sensitive than phone numbers.\n\n**Co-Reviewed By: deep-code-reviewer**",
